; The test lanes' one closure (C5, Codex's R6.1): lanes_gen.ml is GENERATED by `make gen-lcnf` from
; the recipe's artefact whose consumers are the to-do lane, and later the constructor, Modeled
; and Rocq lanes (ocaml/gen/roots.json, `consumers`). One walk of every consumer's roots makes
; one closure, so the lanes share each node they both reach. Each lane reads it through its own
; facade (todo_gen.ml in ../todo, …, GENERATED with it), whose interface keeps that lane's roots
; and the types they name. A test library: nothing installs it, so an outside client names none
; of its roots. Its join points are `let[@local always]`, so warning 55 is an error, as in
; ../../../gen/dune.

(library
 (name effect4_lanes)
 (wrapped false)
 (modules lanes_gen)
 (flags
  (:standard -w @55))
 (no_dynlink)
 (libraries effect4_eff effect4_clock effect4_lcnf))
